"smart_blocks:Computer Science/React/React - JSX (JavaScript XML).md#FFB86CA6;\"> JSX is not understood directly by web browsers. Before the browser can execute the code, a transpiler (like Babel) converts the JSX syntax into standard JavaScript</mark>. For instance, `<h1 className=\"title\">Hello</h1>` might be transpiled into `React.createElement('h1', { className: 'title' }, 'Hello')`.": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.02801987,0.01493552,0.02437216,-0.02378011,0.00642383,0.01870727,-0.0100202,0.04536098,0.04068448,-0.04287934,-0.04368762,0.03816627,0.06953692,0.03980806,-0.00277971,-0.02162291,-0.04064797,0.02054963,-0.01946545,-0.00085144,0.08196393,0.01412476,-0.04454155,-0.04028336,0.03779615,0.05798193,-0.02554097,-0.00666129,-0.003984,-0.15564114,-0.01168073,-0.07238256,0.01542193,0.01144821,-0.04886807,-0.05847492,0.0290623,0.03185277,-0.01031075,0.04945151,-0.01894136,0.05712832,0.02155146,-0.00854358,-0.06998394,-0.05262528,-0.08340822,0.00381444,-0.00374924,0.05273176,-0.03480709,0.00573991,0.0606242,0.00606058,0.06739092,0.10165776,0.03148502,0.05822662,-0.00153955,0.01278632,0.01740402,0.03933639,-0.13286485,0.10774037,0.10347883,0.03652213,-0.00612165,-0.02446397,0.04717596,0.00619668,-0.07730325,0.0051608,0.01057808,0.04859445,0.02362554,-0.05295347,0.04096368,-0.04099795,0.05882201,-0.02591642,-0.07850747,-0.09089667,-0.01030774,0.01399087,0.02817679,-0.01070019,0.03944331,-0.01909748,0.0617481,0.06457415,-0.04117541,-0.09493463,0.01200498,0.01001353,-0.01679225,-0.00283448,0.0290021,0.06380777,0.00142091,0.11453117,-0.0744776,0.0386136,0.03002915,-0.01822709,0.04176459,-0.02202003,-0.03198492,-0.00547654,-0.03296362,-0.03164223,0.016033,-0.02241303,-0.01795329,-0.03144526,-0.02704403,-0.04277535,-0.00884576,-0.02599752,0.06358638,-0.04938383,0.0622237,0.0615329,-0.01450686,0.01763668,0.05015612,-0.00906429,0.02408765,0.02017679,-0.04343039,0.04967973,0.02730262,0.03872367,-0.0423817,-0.00691962,0.01728089,0.0653543,-0